        "created_at": "2012-05-10T19:40:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For ways to shake up the game, I thought of a few comic appropriate things:</p>\n<p>-Villains teaming up for a super team (some mechanic where they interfere with each other possibly?)<br>\n-Heroes fighting heroes (or possibly dopplegangers)</p>",
