        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/8edcca/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-14T16:12:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think I would rather see the &gt;G team come up with a brand new game that had PvP than a SotM expansion for PvP. SotM is so great because it’s cooperative, besides Plague Rat already has a mechanic wherein the heros are forced to hurt each other (which is neat!).</p>",
