      {
        "id": 29539,
        "name": "WriterRyan",
        "username": "WriterRyan",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/writerryan/{size}/2710_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-15T13:54:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;beevolant&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"beevolant\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>besides Plague Rat already has a mechanic wherein the heros are forced to hurt each other (which is neat!).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Christopher can confirm that I not-so-secretly love things like this happening in games. In our D&amp;D campaign, my character was possessed a few times to great effect.  ;D</p>",
