      {
        "id": 29540,
        "name": "Singlog",
        "username": "Singlog",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/singlog/{size}/2788_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-17T14:17:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What would be cool is if they had an expansion that only had one villain, but that villain was so friggin big that the heroes have to defeat different parts of him. So you would still have 4 villain cards, but they are the same villain just a different section of him.</p>",
