      {
        "id": 29547,
        "name": "CrimsonPhoenix",
        "username": "CrimsonPhoenix",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/a9a28c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-17T22:21:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>One thing they could incorporate into the game is the “Story Challenges” and “Sentinel Points” that could effectively be used for campaign play or scenario play.  It could help integrate stories from the “comics” into the game.  Or they could use the SC and SP like in Space Alert: the New Frontier where you gain levels as you play the game repeatedly and those levels allow you to use special perks.  Having played and enjoyed the Space Alert expansion, I for one would love to see either of these things in future Sentinels expansions.</p>",
