        "created_at": "2012-05-20T05:29:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;imprimis5&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"imprimis5\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"msbq\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/msbq/48/2824_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> msbq:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This succession seems most plausible to me. I’ve read comics since I’ve been able to read and these all resonate pretty clearly.<br>\nThe closest thing we’ve got to a Time Traveler is Tachyon’s Barry-Allan-esque super speed.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Visionary is from the future.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>… Well I feel sheepish. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
        "post_number": 29,
        "post_type": 1,
