        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chwineka/{size}/34_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-20T06:41:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Maybe a larger expansion focusing on another superhero team? The heroes so far are largely the Freedom Five and a bunch of other, generally solo heroes. Yeah, teams don’t really come through gameplay, but I’d be curious about other heroes running around together.</p>",
