        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-20T15:25:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was thinking that perhaps they could introduce new game mechanics that would change how the game was played.  Adding things like tapping cards so they’re not always available or dice rolls for things with random effects, or tokens to keep track of effects which play out over time rather than happening all at once could make the game feel quite different.</p>",
