        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-20T18:29:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Unfortunately, any attempt to tap a card (even using a different term) results in having to pay royalties to Wizards of the Coast (as utterly ridiculous as that is). &gt;:(</p>\n<p>I’m betting there will be forms of randomness introduced. (Maybe even in the next set… :-X) I think they’re doing a good job keeping things interesting, so far, and I’m assuming the trend will continue.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>\n<p>Rabit</p>",
